[00:13.56]1. We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:15.28]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:23.16]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:23.16]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[00:23.16]2. We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[00:43.46]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[00:44.62]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[00:46.36]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[00:46.44]3. We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[00:46.46]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[00:54.28]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[00:59.64]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.
